This is a placeholder licence. munshiji-full-report.md §13.4 recommends either:

  1. A proprietary EULA — closed source, perpetual licence for the shipped
     major version, paid major-version upgrades; or
  2. An open-core split — router, tools, and voice loop under AGPL-3.0, with
     the Indic layer, GUI, and Office/COM integration kept proprietary.

Neither has been finalized yet — see docs/LICENSING-AUDIT.md "Open decisions"
for status. Do not treat this file as final, and do not distribute the
software under this placeholder text. Replace it with the actual chosen
licence (and, if open-core, split the repository accordingly) before any
public release.

This is not legal advice. Consult a lawyer before commercial launch.
